  "priorExpiration": "2004-05-30",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pes 507.02 Prevention of Drift/Contamination. No application of pesticides shall be made by mechanically powered equipment at such times when the wind velocity shall cause said pesticide to contaminate a non-target area.\n\nSource. #2781, eff 7-26-84; ss by #4867, eff 7-19-90; ss by #6258, eff 5-30-96, EXPIRED: 5-30-04\n\nNew. #8131, eff 8-13-04; ss by #10333, eff 5-10-13; ss by #14064, eff 8-22-24",
